{"fps": 30, "frames": 1591, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 185, "text": "Imagine you set out to prove stocks are a bad investment, and end up fuelling the Roaring Twenties.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 8, "e": 20}, {"w": "you", "f": 21, "e": 27}, {"w": "set", "f": 28, "e": 34}, {"w": "out", "f": 34, "e": 40}, {"w": "to", "f": 41, "e": 45}, {"w": "prove", "f": 46, "e": 55}, {"w": "stocks", "f": 56, "e": 67}, {"w": "are", "f": 68, "e": 74}, {"w": "a", "f": 74, "e": 77}, {"w": "bad", "f": 78, "e": 84}, {"w": "investment,", "f": 84, "e": 104}, {"w": "and", "f": 104, "e": 110}, {"w": "end", "f": 111, "e": 117}, {"w": "up", "f": 118, "e": 122}, {"w": "fuelling", "f": 123, "e": 137}, {"w": "the", "f": 138, "e": 144}, {"w": "Roaring", "f": 144, "e": 157}, {"w": "Twenties.", "f": 158, "e": 174}]}, {"a": 185, "b": 355, "text": "It's nineteen twenty-four. You're Edgar Lawrence Smith, and you plan a pamphlet: bonds beat stocks.", "words": [{"w": "It's", "f": 187, "e": 195}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 195, "e": 209}, {"w": "twenty-four.", "f": 210, "e": 230}, {"w": "You're", "f": 231, "e": 241}, {"w": "Edgar", "f": 242, "e": 251}, {"w": "Lawrence", "f": 252, "e": 265}, {"w": "Smith,", "f": 266, "e": 277}, {"w": "and", "f": 277, "e": 283}, {"w": "you", "f": 284, "e": 289}, {"w": "plan", "f": 290, "e": 297}, {"w": "a", "f": 298, "e": 301}, {"w": "pamphlet:", "f": 301, "e": 317}, {"w": "bonds", "f": 317, "e": 326}, {"w": "beat", "f": 327, "e": 334}, {"w": "stocks.", "f": 335, "e": 347}]}, {"a": 355, "b": 515, "text": "You test half a century of real prices, stacking every test in favour of bonds.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 357, "e": 364}, {"w": "test", "f": 364, "e": 373}, {"w": "half", "f": 374, "e": 383}, {"w": "a", "f": 383, "e": 386}, {"w": "century", "f": 387, "e": 401}, {"w": "of", "f": 402, "e": 407}, {"w": "real", "f": 408, "e": 417}, {"w": "prices,", "f": 417, "e": 432}, {"w": "stacking", "f": 432, "e": 449}, {"w": "every", "f": 449, "e": 460}, {"w": "test", "f": 461, "e": 47